{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world where immortality has become the norm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, immortal humans are referred to as &quot;Players.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Imitation</strong> is a choice-driven adventure game set in a world where immortality is ordinary. The full experience can be completed in about <strong>3 to 3.5 hours</strong>. You take on the role of a young girl living in this world, experiencing the story from her perspective.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions and actions affect <strong>Stress</strong> and <strong>Affinity</strong>, which in turn change the information you receive and the actions available to you. You cannot discover everything in a single playthrough. By replaying the game and trying different choices, you will gather hidden information and gradually get closer to a better ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because in the end, it is something only you can achieve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique story set in a world where immortality is the norm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the perspective of a young girl in a society of immortal &quot;Players&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic Stress and Affinity system that influences story progression and available actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay-focused structure where new information and endings unlock with each run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character relationships and accumulated knowledge deepen the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approximately 3\u20133.5 hours to experience the full story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c